flowchart TD
    A([Start Recommendation]) --> B{Weather set?}
    B -->|No| C[Show message: enter weather first]
    B -->|Yes| D[Ask budget level]
    D --> E[Ask available money]
    E --> F[Loop through FoodItem vector]
    F --> G{Weather matches?}
    G -->|No| F
    G -->|Yes| H{Budget matches?}
    H -->|No| F
    H -->|Yes| I{Price <= money?}
    I -->|No| F
    I -->|Yes| J[Display recommendation]
    J --> F
    F --> K{Any result found?}
    K -->|No| L[Show no matching recommendation]
    K -->|Yes| M[Ask if user wants to save favorite]
    M --> N{Save?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Push selected FoodItem to favorites]
    N -->|No| P[Return to menu]
    O --> P
    C --> P
    L --> P
